---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Terms & Conditions — UAE Gratuity Calculator';
const description =
  'Terms and Conditions for using UAE Gratuity Calculator. This tool provides estimates only and does not constitute legal advice.';

const lastUpdated = 'June 2025';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="bg-canvas py-12 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-mute uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">LEGAL</p>
      <h1 class="text-[32px] sm:text-[40px] font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-1.5px] text-ink mb-3">
        Terms &amp; Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-mute mb-12">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-[16px] text-body leading-[1.75]">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing and using <strong class="text-ink font-medium">calculateuaegratuity.com</strong> (the "Site"), you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">2. Nature of the service</h2>
          <p>
            UAE Gratuity Calculator is a free informational tool that provides <strong class="text-ink font-medium">estimates only</strong>. Calculations are based on the formula set out in UAE Federal Decree-Law No. 33 of 2021, Article 51.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            The Site does not provide legal advice. Results should not be relied upon as a substitute for professional legal counsel or official determination by the Ministry of Human Resources and Emiratisation (MOHRE).
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">3. Accuracy and limitations</h2>
          <p>
            We make reasonable efforts to keep calculations aligned with current UAE labour law. However, we make no warranty — express or implied — regarding the accuracy, completeness, or fitness for a particular purpose of any result produced by this tool.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">Actual gratuity entitlements may differ due to:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 pl-5 list-disc marker:text-mute">
            <li>Non-standard or negotiated contract terms</li>
            <li>Specific free-zone regulations (DIFC, ADGM, and others)</li>
            <li>Legal interpretations or court rulings not reflected in the statutory formula</li>
            <li>Changes to UAE labour law after the date of this tool's last update</li>
            <li>Errors in the inputs you provide</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">4. Not legal advice</h2>
          <p>
            Nothing on this Site constitutes legal advice or creates a lawyer-client relationship. For binding determinations regarding your gratuity entitlement, you should:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 pl-5 list-disc marker:text-mute">
            <li>Consult a UAE-qualified employment lawyer</li>
            <li>Contact MOHRE at <strong class="text-ink">800-60</strong> or via the MOHRE application</li>
            <li>Review your specific employment contract and its terms</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">5. Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, UAE Gratuity Calculator and its operators shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 pl-5 list-disc marker:text-mute">
            <li>Your use of or reliance on the calculator results</li>
            <li>Any errors or omissions in the calculations</li>
            <li>Any action or inaction taken based on information provided on this Site</li>
            <li>Discrepancies between the calculator output and your actual legal entitlement</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">6. Intellectual property</h2>
          <p>
            All content on this Site — including text, design, code, and structure — is the property of UAE Gratuity Calculator. You may use the calculator for personal, non-commercial purposes. You may not reproduce, scrape, or redistribute the Site's content without prior written permission.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">7. Third-party services</h2>
          <p>
            The Site uses Google Translate for optional page translation. Use of this feature is subject to Google's own terms of service and privacy policy. We are not responsible for Google's handling of any data.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">8. Governing law</h2>
          <p>
            These Terms are governed by and construed in accordance with applicable law. Any disputes arising from or related to the use of this Site shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the relevant courts.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">9. Changes to terms</h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to update these Terms at any time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision. Continued use of the Site after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the updated terms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">10. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about these Terms? Contact us via the <a href="/contact" class="text-link hover:underline">contact page</a> or at <a href="mailto:hello@calculateuaegratuity.com" class="text-link hover:underline font-mono text-[14px]">hello@calculateuaegratuity.com</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-hairline">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 16l-4-4m0 0l4-4m-4 4h18"/>
          </svg>
          Back to calculator
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
